"stem":"What medium is especially central to the international importance of Ravenna's fifth- and sixth-century church interiors?","choices":["Aquatint","Mosaic","Lithography","Oil on canvas","Woodcut"],"correctIndex":1,"answer":"Mosaic","explanation":"Ravenna preserves major late-antique and early Byzantine mosaics; the other options are different image-making media.","format":"material","references":[{"file":"Editorial reference: Ravenna","page":null,"verificationUrl":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/788/"}],"examLanguages":["en","it"],"scope":"shared","version":"editorial-v76","editorialStatus74":"ready","skill74":"material","topic74":"Ravenna","difficulty74":"unrated","lineage74":"Original editorial item; Alpha transcription used to benchmark concise options. Not an official CISIA question.","evidence":{"type":"editorial","referenceBasis":"Institutional reference","checkedAt":"2026-10-05"},"editorial75":{"sourceKey":"ravenna","optionWords":[1,1,1,3,1],"difficultyStatus":"Not calibrated with candidates","syllabusArea":"historical-cultural-space-time"},"fingerprint":"1fa259be73303c4f0655"},{"id":"GEN43-Q01005","qid":1005,"nodeId":"EDITORIAL74-005","relatedNodeIds":["EDITORIAL74-005"],"factIds":["EDITORIAL74-005"],"major":"Art History","group":"Ravenna","stem":"Which of these Ravenna monuments stands in Classe?","choices":["The Orthodox Baptistery","Galla Placidia's mausoleum","San Vitale","The Arian Baptistery","Sant'Apollinare"],"correctIndex":4,"answer":"Sant'Apollinare","explanation":"Sant'Apollinare in Classe stands near Ravenna's ancient port; the other monuments are in Ravenna itself.","format":"distinction","references":[{"file":"Editorial reference: Ravenna","page":null,"verificationUrl":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/788/"}],"examLanguages":["en","it"],"scope":"shared","version":"editorial-v76","editorialStatus74":"ready","skill74":"distinction","topic74":"Ravenna","difficulty74":"unrated","lineage74":"Original editorial item; Alpha transcription used to 