io is a major collected edition of whose plays?","choices":["Christopher Marlowe","John Webster","William Shakespeare","Thomas Middleton","Ben Jonson"],"correctIndex":2,"answer":"William Shakespeare","explanation":"Published in 1623, it preserved eighteen plays not previously printed, including Macbeth.","format":"context","references":[{"file":"Editorial reference: Shakespeare","page":null,"verificationUrl":"https://www.folger.edu/explore/shakespeare-in-print/first-folio/"}],"examLanguages":["en","it"],"scope":"shared","version":"editorial-v76","editorialStatus74":"ready","skill74":"context","topic74":"Shakespeare","difficulty74":"unrated","lineage74":"Original editorial item; Alpha transcription used to benchmark concise options. Not an official CISIA question.","evidence":{"type":"editorial","referenceBasis":"Institutional reference","checkedAt":"2026-10-05"},"editorial75":{"sourceKey":"folio","optionWords":[2,2,2,2,2],"difficultyStatus":"Not calibrated with candidates","syllabusArea":"historical-cultural-space-time"},"fingerprint":"efa7828e940457ef4f8f"},{"id":"GEN43-Q01041","qid":1041,"nodeId":"EDITORIAL74-041","relatedNodeIds":["EDITORIAL74-041"],"factIds":["EDITORIAL74-041"],"major":"Language & Literature","group":"Shakespeare","stem":"Shakespeare’s First Folio appeared in which year?","choices":["1603","1593","1633","1623","1613"],"correctIndex":3,"answer":"1623","explanation":"The collection appeared in 1623, seven years after Shakespeare’s death in 1616.","format":"chronology","references":[{"file":"Editorial reference: Shakespeare","page":null,"verificationUrl":"https://www.folger.edu/explore/shakespeare-in-print/first-folio/"}],"examLanguages":["en","it"],"scope":"shared","version":"editorial-v76","editorialStatus74":"ready","skill74":"chronology","topic74":"Shakespeare","difficulty74":"unrated","lineage74":"Original editorial item; Alpha transcription used to benchmark concise options. Not an official CISIA question.","evidence":{"type":"editorial","ref